                                "sense_id": "82773a9a-72bb-3b8e-809f-41b96d2f677c",
                                "text": "...it was observed that overt definite pronouns may also function adjectivally in various languages..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36774ef2-598f-4cce-85c4-a4c41f816f96",
                                "sense_id": "82773a9a-72bb-3b8e-809f-41b96d2f677c",
                                "text": "All attributive adjectives function adjectivally; an attributive adjective cannot function substantivally."
